 "words": 197,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The Teacher came to Bethany and Martha opened wide",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Her door, her bread, her table, and the fire burned inside",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Her sister sat at the Lord's feet and listened to his word",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "While Martha served alone and felt that no one saw or heard",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord, don't you care that my sister has left me to serve alone",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Tell her to help me",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Martha, Martha, anxious over many things",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Few things are needed, only one",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The good portion at his feet",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Will not be taken away",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then sorrow came to Bethany, her brother in the grave",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Four days in the tomb and nothing left to save",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She ran to meet him on the road before the others came",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord, if you had been here, my brother would not have died",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus said to her, I am the resurrection and the life",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do you believe this",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yes, Lord",
   "heard": 2,
   "words": 2,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I believe that you are the Christ, the Son of God",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The one coming into the world",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
